Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:04.30,ZH,celia,0,0,0,,汤姆，你真混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:04.30,EN,celia,0,0,0,,You're a jerk, Thom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.95,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,西莉亚，我们得追随热爱。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.95,EN,thom,0,0,0,,Look Celia, we have to follow our\Npassions;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:09.98,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,你爱机器人，我想在太空大展身手。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:09.98,EN,thom,0,0,0,,...you have your robotics, and I just want\Nto be awesome in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.42,0:00:14.32,ZH,celia,0,0,0,,你就承认吧，你怕我的机械手。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.42,0:00:14.32,EN,celia,0,0,0,,Why don't you just admit that you're\Nfreaked out by my robot hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.55,0:00:16.35,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,我才没怕，我是……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.55,0:00:16.35,EN,thom,0,0,0,,I'm not freaked out by- it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:18.30,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,好吧！行！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:18.30,EN,thom,0,0,0,,...alright! Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:20.82,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,我是怕！我做噩梦，被追着跑……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:20.82,EN,thom,0,0,0,,I'm freaked out! I have nightmares that\NI'm being chased...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.82,0:00:22.43,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,追我的是巨大的夺命机械爪！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.82,0:00:22.43,EN,thom,0,0,0,,by these giant robotic claws of death…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.10,0:00:25.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(640,392)\fs25}四十年后
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.10,0:00:25.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(640,420)\fs20}Forty years later
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:23.48,ZH,celia,0,0,0,,随你吧，汤姆。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:23.48,EN,celia,0,0,0,,Whatever, Thom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:24.98,ZH,celia,0,0,0,,我们完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:24.98,EN,celia,0,0,0,,We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:33.55,ZH,operator,0,0,0,,机器人记忆已同步，已锁定！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:33.55,EN,operator,0,0,0,,Robot's memory synced and locked!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:42.30,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,这可真够吓人的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:42.30,EN,captain,0,0,0,,This is pretty freaky.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.15,0:00:48.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(640,392)\fs25}钢铁之泪
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.15,0:00:48.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(640,420)\fs20}Tears of Steel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:38.65,ZH,barley,0,0,0,,你不该下去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:38.65,EN,barley,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.85,ZH,barley,0,0,0,,昨晚我听见你们谈话了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.85,EN,barley,0,0,0,,I heard you guys talking last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:57.75,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,这可不是我的错。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:57.75,EN,thom,0,0,0,,It's not my fault, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:52.08,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:52.08,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:54.55,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,当然好了，你可是大明星。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:54.55,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Of course you're ready, you're a rockstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:58.15,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,巴利，情况如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:58.15,EN,captain,0,0,0,,How's it looking, Barley?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:03:00.42,ZH,barley,0,0,0,,大概还有十分钟。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:03:00.42,EN,barley,0,0,0,,We should have about ten minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:02.65,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,那就太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:02.65,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Well that's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:07.40,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,一分钟后开场！\N各系统就位！对，你，快去！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:07.40,EN,captain,0,0,0,,We're on in one! All systems go! Yeah you,\Ngo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:12.10,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,快！都动起来！快快快！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:12.10,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Go! Move your asses! Go go go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:16.60,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,太棒了！来，快！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:16.60,EN,captain,0,0,0,,I love it! Come on, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.63,0:03:23.64,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,真不错。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.63,0:03:23.64,EN,captain,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:25.60,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,没什么好担心的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:25.60,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:31.00,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,汤姆。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:31.00,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Thom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:32.85,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,她就在那儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:32.85,EN,captain,0,0,0,,There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:34.20,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,现在。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:34.20,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:36.25,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,你爱她。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:36.25,EN,captain,0,0,0,,You love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.35,0:03:38.45,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,她就是你的热爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.35,0:03:38.45,EN,captain,0,0,0,,She is your passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:40.65,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,对她温柔点。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:40.65,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Be tender to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.30,0:03:42.08,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,要诚恳！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.30,0:03:42.08,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Be honest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.67,0:03:44.28,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,呃，要温柔。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.67,0:03:44.28,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Eh—be tender.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:48.03,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,让她想起，什么是爱。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.35,0:03:48.03,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Remind her what love is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:34.75,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,预备，开拍！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:34.75,EN,captain,0,0,0,,...and, action!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:38.18,ZH,operator,0,0,0,,记忆覆写进行中！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:38.18,EN,operator,0,0,0,,Memory overwrite in progress!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.15,0:04:40.55,ZH,celia,0,0,0,,汤姆，你真混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.15,0:04:40.55,EN,celia,0,0,0,,You're a jerk, Thom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.75,0:04:44.10,ZH,operator,0,0,0,,哦，对不起！对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.75,0:04:44.10,EN,operator,0,0,0,,Ohp- Sorry! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:56.75,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,西莉亚。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:56.75,EN,thom,0,0,0,,Look Celia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:05:00.15,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,我们得追随热爱。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:05:00.15,EN,thom,0,0,0,,We have to follow our passions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:02.48,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,你爱机器人……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:02.48,EN,thom,0,0,0,,You have your robotics...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:07.62,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,我想在太空大展身手。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:07.62,EN,thom,0,0,0,,...and I just want to be awesome in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:21.12,ZH,barley,0,0,0,,他们来了，只剩两分钟！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:21.12,EN,barley,0,0,0,,Okay, they're coming. Two minutes left!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:23.75,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,汤姆，快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:23.75,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Speed it up, Thom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:25.98,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,再快一点！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:25.98,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Vivacissimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.53,0:05:30.08,ZH,celia,0,0,0,,你就承认吧，你怕我的机械手。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.53,0:05:30.08,EN,celia,0,0,0,,Why don't you just admit that you're\Nfreaked out by my robot hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.90,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,听我说，西莉亚。我那时年轻……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.90,EN,thom,0,0,0,,Listen Celia, I was young...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:40.50,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,又混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:40.50,EN,thom,0,0,0,,...and a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.95,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,可这不是毁灭世界的理由。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.95,EN,thom,0,0,0,,But that's no reason to destroy the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:45.85,ZH,assistant,0,0,0,,他干嘛这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:45.85,EN,assistant,0,0,0,,Why does he do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:48.45,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,这招我们已经试过了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:48.45,EN,captain,0,0,0,,We already tried that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:52.45,ZH,assistant,0,0,0,,中止！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:52.45,EN,assistant,0,0,0,,Abort!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.05,0:05:53.80,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,停拍！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.05,0:05:53.80,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.05,0:05:56.20,ZH,operator,0,0,0,,哇——！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.05,0:05:56.20,EN,operator,0,0,0,,Whoaaa!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.13,0:05:57.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(640,392)\fs25}回放
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.13,0:05:57.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(640,420)\fs20}PLAYBACK
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.18,0:05:58.50,ZH,operator,0,0,0,,哇——！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.18,0:05:58.50,EN,operator,0,0,0,,Whoaaa!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.58,0:05:59.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(640,392)\fs25}错误！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.58,0:05:59.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(640,420)\fs20}ERROR!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:02.35,ZH,operator,0,0,0,,不要——！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:02.35,EN,operator,0,0,0,,Nooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:04.95,ZH,celia,0,0,0,,你伤透了我的心。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:04.95,EN,celia,0,0,0,,You broke my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:06.56,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:06.56,EN,thom,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:08.63,ZH,celia,0,0,0,,你把我忘在了地球。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:08.63,EN,celia,0,0,0,,You forgot me on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:09.95,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:09.95,EN,thom,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:12.20,ZH,celia,0,0,0,,我真该捏碎你。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:12.20,EN,celia,0,0,0,,I should just crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.78,0:06:17.65,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,我……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.78,0:06:17.65,EN,thom,0,0,0,,I'm-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:28.28,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:28.28,EN,thom,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:31.10,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,临场发挥得好。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:31.10,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Good ad-lib.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:40.02,ZH,operator,0,0,0,,不是我的错！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:40.02,EN,operator,0,0,0,,Not my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:42.83,ZH,operator,0,0,0,,这回不是。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:42.83,EN,operator,0,0,0,,This time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:49.48,ZH,captain,0,0,0,,片场肃静！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:49.48,EN,captain,0,0,0,,Quiet on set!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:51.42,ZH,barley,0,0,0,,没时间了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:51.42,EN,barley,0,0,0,,We're out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.55,0:07:45.40,ZH,barley,0,0,0,,快呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.55,0:07:45.40,EN,barley,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:03.40,ZH,barley,0,0,0,,啊——！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:03.40,EN,barley,0,0,0,,RAAAAAAAAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.72,0:08:05.67,ZH,operator,0,0,0,,记忆覆写，百分之九十！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.72,0:08:05.67,EN,operator,0,0,0,,Memory overwrite, 90%.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.24,0:08:08.25,ZH,assistant,0,0,0,,队长！必须中止！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.24,0:08:08.25,EN,assistant,0,0,0,,Captain! We have to abort!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:20.62,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,世界变了，西莉亚……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:20.62,EN,thom,0,0,0,,The world's changed, Celia...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.56,0:08:36.10,ZH,thom,0,0,0,,也许我们也能改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.56,0:08:36.10,EN,thom,0,0,0,,...maybe we can too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:39.25,ZH,operator,0,0,0,,记忆覆写完成！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:39.25,EN,operator,0,0,0,,Memory overwrite complete!
